Test assets (test-assets/data)
  Taken unchanged from libGDX's repository (tests/gdx-tests-android/assets/data), where they are distributed with libGDX's own tests:
    uiskin.json, uiskin.atlas, uiskin.png  libGDX's default Scene2D skin (Apache-2.0)
    default.fnt, default.png               bitmap font rendered from Droid Sans (Apache-2.0)
    lsans-15.fnt, lsans-15_00.png, lsans.ttf  libGDX's built-in "LSans" font, which replaced Arial in the libGDX distribution
    test.p, particle*.png                  a particle effect and its images from libGDX's tests
  They are used only by the tests. Check the licence of a font before redistributing it outside this repository.

